{"speciesId":459,"names":{"fr":"Blizzi","es":"Snover","en":"Snover","ja":"ユキカブリ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"It lives on snowy mountains. Having had little contact with humans, it is boldly inquisitive."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"In the spring, it grows berries with the texture of frozen treats around its belly."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"Seemingly curious about people, they gather around footsteps they find on snowy mountains."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"During cold seasons, it migrates to the mountain’s lower reaches. It returns to the snow-covered summit in the spring."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"During cold seasons, it migrates to the mountain’s lower reaches. It returns to the snow-covered summit in the spring."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Curieux de rencontrer des gens, ils se rassemblent autour des traces de pas trouvées dans la montagne."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"Seemingly curious about people, they gather around footsteps they find on snowy mountains."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Curieux de rencontrer des gens, ils se rassemblent autour des traces de pas trouvées dans la montagne."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"Seemingly curious about people, they gather around footsteps they find on snowy mountains."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"Seemingly curious about people, they gather around footsteps they find on snowy mountains."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"Seemingly curious about people, they gather around footsteps they find on snowy mountains."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Il s’aventure jusqu’au pied des montagnes en hiver, mais se réfugie sur les pics neigeux au printemps."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"En las estaciones frías baja al pie de la montaña, pero regresa a las cimas nevadas en primavera."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"During cold seasons, it migrates to the mountain’s lower reaches. It returns to the snow-covered summit in the spring."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"寒い 季節は 山の ふもとまで 降りてくるが 春に なると 雪が 残る 山頂に 戻っていく。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Au printemps, il fait pousser des Baies pareilles à des crèmes glacées autour de son ventre."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"En primavera, le crecen bayas con apariencia de helado alrededor de la panza."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"In the spring, it grows berries with the texture of frozen treats around its belly."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"春になると アイスキャンディーの ような 触感の 木の実が お腹の まわりに 生る。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Il s’aventure jusqu’au pied des montagnes en hiver, mais se réfugie sur les pics neigeux au printemps."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"En las estaciones frías baja al pie de la montaña, pero regresa a las cimas nevadas en primavera."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"During cold seasons, it migrates to the mountain’s lower reaches. It returns to the snow-covered summit in the spring."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"寒い 季節は 山の ふもとまで 降りてくるが 春に なると 雪が 残る 山頂に 戻っていく。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Au printemps, il fait pousser des Baies pareilles à des crèmes glacées autour de son ventre."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"En primavera, le crecen bayas con apariencia de helado alrededor de la panza."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"In the spring, it grows berries with the texture of frozen treats around its belly."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"春になると アイスキャンディーの ような 食感の 木の実が お腹の まわりに 生る。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Il plante ses pieds dans la neige des montagnes où il vit pour absorber l’air froid et l’humidité."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Viven en montañas perennemente nevadas. Hunden las piernas en la nieve y absorben tanto humedad como aire frío."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"It lives on snowy mountains. It sinks its legs into the snow to absorb water and keep its own temperature down."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"雪深い 山に暮らす。 雪に 脚を 突き刺して 水分と 冷気を 吸収 するぞ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Les Baies en forme de crèmes glacées qui poussent sur son ventre sont le mets favori des Darumarond vivant à Galar."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Las bayas con aspecto de helado que le crecen alrededor de la barriga son la comida favorita de los Darumaka que habitan en Galar."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"The berries that grow around its belly are like ice pops. Galarian Darumaka absolutely love these berries."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"お腹に 実る アイス みたいな 木の実は ガラルに 暮らす ダルマッカたちの 大好物。"},{"language":"en","version":"legends-arceus","text":"One is likely to encounter this Pokémon while out in the snow. There are stories of Snover appearing in human settlements but doing no harm—rather, they bond with the children."}],"varieties":[{"id":459,"moves":[{"name":"mega-punch","learns":[[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"ice-punch","learns":[[9,"tutor",0],[10,"tutor",0],[14,"tutor",0],[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"swords-dance","learns":[[8,"machine",0],[9,"machine",0],[10,"machine",0],[11,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0],[23,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"stomp","learns":[[8,"egg",0],[9,"egg",0],[10,"egg",0],[11,"egg",0],[14,"egg",0],[15,"egg",0],[16,"egg",0],[17,"egg",0],[18,"egg",0],[20,"egg",0],[23,"egg",0],[25,"egg",0]]},{"name":"headbutt","learns":[[10,"tutor",0]]},{"name":"body-slam","learns":[[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"take-down","learns":[[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"double-edge","learns":[[8,"egg",0],[9,"egg",0],[10,"egg",0],[11,"egg",0],[14,"egg",0],[1